#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-quick-edit.rst:5
#: afeed219ec6847f4b93acdeb7f032daf
msgid "Wiki Editing - Quick Edits"
msgstr "Wiki 编辑 - 快速编辑"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-quick-edit.rst:7
#: b8fafca0f7114789a53be7a7a5c2c7ff
msgid "Below is a video tutorial for quickly editing the ArduPilot wiki"
msgstr "以下是快速编辑 ArduPilot wiki 的视频教程"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-quick-edit.rst:12
#: eb5e0842c0f64edbbff5902ff8b806bc
msgid ""
"Create a `Github account <https://github.com/join>`__ if you do not have one"
" already"
msgstr "如尚未拥有 `GitHub 账号 <https://github.com/join>`__，请先创建一个"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-quick-edit.rst:13
#: cee68dcd79404f5ead5a3c7e7980743e
msgid ""
"Find the page you wish to edit and click the **Edit on GitHub** link on the "
"top right of the page to be taken to its source"
msgstr "找到要编辑的页面，点击页面右上角的 **Edit on GitHub** 链接，跳转到其源文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-quick-edit.rst:14
#: d00ea558e78a4fbfb9ff007550108ed6
msgid "Select the **Edit this file** icon"
msgstr "点击 **Edit this file** 图标"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-quick-edit.rst:18
#: 1037439f18ae4e05818bf48994a5bbbc
msgid ""
"Make the changes in the \"Edit file\" tab and use the \"Preview changes\" "
"tab to check the change.  Note: links to other wiki pages are not rendered "
"properly and will appear with ``:ref:``` in front"
msgstr ""
"在「Edit file」标签页中进行修改，并使用「Preview changes」标签页检查效果。注意：指向其他 wiki "
"页面的链接无法正确渲染，前面会出现 ``:ref:```"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-quick-edit.rst:19
#: 61265674d1b144b09e28d6c01f442ec2
msgid "At the bottom of the page under \"Commit changes\""
msgstr "在页面底部「Commit changes」下"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-quick-edit.rst:21
#: 9c5b56c5501043d59e1c8b88e8b238e3
msgid "Fill in the subject line with a short description of the change"
msgstr "在主题行填写简短的变更描述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-quick-edit.rst:22
#: d04aacf3ac2d49ddaa720e7349b0b5c2
msgid "Optionally fill in an extended description"
msgstr "可选填写扩展描述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-quick-edit.rst:23
#: 9fcb9a13ef894af3960c54b4362f0764
msgid "Click \"Create a new branch for this commit\""
msgstr "点击「Create a new branch for this commit」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-quick-edit.rst:24
#: 0eb0698ff4e54e88ab6538585cab5c07
msgid "Press the \"Commit changes\" button"
msgstr "点击「Commit changes」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-quick-edit.rst:26
#: 69fb829047054d1aae85566cc8abea0f
msgid ""
"When taken to the \"Open a pull request\" screen, press the \"Create pull "
"request\" button"
msgstr "跳转到「Open a pull request」界面后，点击「Create pull request」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-quick-edit.rst:28
#: af92420e274641858404940c06173608
msgid ""
"For more information see the Github Help topic: `Editing files in another "
"user's repository <https://help.github.com/articles/editing-files-in-"
"another-user-s-repository/>`__"
msgstr ""
"更多信息参见 Github 帮助主题：`Editing files in another user's repository "
"<https://help.github.com/articles/editing-files-in-another-user-s-"
"repository/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-quick-edit.rst:32
#: 14a1b91862df451687f5d02065a2e6ca
msgid ""
"Wiki home pages (named \"index.html\") do not have the **Edit on GitHub** "
"link. You can still edit them by manually navigating to the desired page on "
"Github."
msgstr ""
"Wiki 首页（名为「index.html」）没有 **Edit on GitHub** 链接。您仍可通过手动在 Github "
"上导航到对应页面来编辑它们。"
